# nav-probe actions: BFME II from the main menu to a Harlindon skirmish against the AI, then
# two minutes of in-game sensors. Coordinates are the label hit rectangles read from the APT
# menu textures (800×600): SOLO, then ESCARMOUCHE in its submenu, then JOUER on the setup screen.
# The presentation path is forced direct: the bench's CPU readback path degrades over minutes.
dbg d3d9DirectPresent true
wait 20
click 217,556
quick click 217,381
wait 6
uimap
quick click 704,573
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
wait 15
dbg faults
dbg messageBoxes
harness stubs
dbg waitGraph
quit
